+    ) -> None:
+        """Compose one chunk's kept slots into logical retained positions, per KV head column.
+
+        The cache a cluster holds when an eviction runs is ``prev_kept`` surviving slots followed by this
+        chunk's ``chunk_len`` new ones, so the logical position of slot ``j`` after the eviction is
+        ``before[keep[j]]`` with ``before = prev_positions ++ arange(chunk_start, chunk_end)``. Applying that
+        per column is what makes the readout correct for a scorer whose ranking differs across heads. A
+        ``None`` entry means the cluster kept everything, i.e. ``keep`` is the identity.
+        """
